{
  "name": "sd-jwt-decoder",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "A purely client-side tool to decode Selective Disclosure JWTs (SD-JWT), verify _sd digests and Key Binding JWTs, and optionally verify the issuer signature with a supplied public key (JWK). Built with Vite, React, Tailwind CSS v4, and jose; ships as a static site compatible with a strict CSP.",
